8-10-29T18:15:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9240326881408691,"text_excerpt":"Definitely worth trying if you're in the area. I had the grilled catfish and red beans & rice. Rice was bland and overcooked but the beans, catfish, and cornbread were delicious! Owner and chef were really nice and I got my food in less then 10 min. Will definitely be back!"},{"business_id":"FFswTVJc-omih2HShm0a6A","review_id":"TJQLfSMsy_Fv5JKMQ7gwGw","date":"2019-10-25T02:09:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9191867709159851,"text_excerpt":"We went today because we didn't feel like cooking. However, it was a great choice. It was a little hard to find though. Food: I got the beef wrap and crab rice. He got the chicken quesadilla. I loved the wrap. It was amazing. Portion size was good. Crab rice was good. It seemed to have cheese in it which was weird but it was still pretty good. Wish there was more crab meat in there. The quesadilla was good but the portion size was soooo small. It definitely wasn't enough. Also the wraps and things like that should come with fries or something. Pineapple lemonade was decent. It was pink lemonade with pineapple juice added. Staff: the young man at the register was so nice and helpful. He wa..."},{"business_id":"FFswTVJc-omih2HShm0a6A","review_id":"8gjcDseJz6H9Th2dId88PQ","date":"2017-04-07T23:18:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9184889197349548,"text_excerpt":"So....I'm super pick about where I eat, but don't let the outside of this shop fool ya like it did me. Clean inside....you can see them cooking your food and preparing...decorated ok...and they even took my order 15 mins before closing and stood a few minutes later after closing. This is a small restaurant that does big business. The food was awesome and very tasty. Prices were a little higher than I'd like to pay, but I will be back!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FFswTVJc-omih2HShm0a6A","photo_id":"HfbgDi7aD5XOkeigfrVvEg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/HfbgDi7aD5